{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 14322850302733975096,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "inotify and fanotify",
      "source_hash": 17147450051002030957,
      "context_hash": 1894653691720037743,
      "translation": "inotify와 fanotify",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Filesystem event notification: watching files and directories for changes",
      "source_hash": 8217644507029105616,
      "context_hash": 13423436118090974411,
      "translation": "파일시스템 이벤트 알림: 파일과 디렉터리의 변경 감시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "inotify: file/directory watch API",
      "source_hash": 16713605096199256342,
      "context_hash": 11683860722522932935,
      "translation": "inotify: 파일/디렉터리 감시 API",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "API": "API"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`inotify` provides notifications when files or directories change.",
      "source_hash": 10742626639406122764,
      "context_hash": 432261552065931133,
      "translation": "`inotify`는 파일이나 디렉터리가 변경될 때 알림을 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It was introduced in Linux 2.6.13 by Robert Love, based on earlier work by John McCutchan [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/0eeca28300df110bd6ed54b31193c83b87921443) [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/104343/), replacing the older **dnotify** mechanism which had a directory-only, signal-based interface.",
      "source_hash": 827190026138564847,
      "context_hash": 13129955918387894849,
      "translation": "이 기능은 John McCutchan의 이전 작업을 바탕으로 Robert Love가 Linux 2.6.13에서 도입했으며 [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/0eeca28300df110bd6ed54b31193c83b87921443) [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/104343/), 디렉터리 전용의 시그널 기반 인터페이스를 가졌던 기존 **dnotify** 메커니즘을 대체했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "It's used by file managers, build systems, editors, and container runtimes.",
      "source_hash": 10535064045837853870,
      "context_hash": 5689137067792773248,
      "translation": "파일 관리자, 빌드 시스템, 편집기, 컨테이너 런타임에서 사용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "container runtimes": "컨테이너 런타임"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Event masks",
      "source_hash": 5828299631327832084,
      "context_hash": 2720639938715278140,
      "translation": "이벤트 마스크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Rename detection with cookie",
      "source_hash": 10494543550098596236,
      "context_hash": 7575939093099497468,
      "translation": "cookie를 이용한 이름 변경 감지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`IN_MOVED_FROM` and `IN_MOVED_TO` events for the same rename share a `cookie` value:",
      "source_hash": 5152435583390162365,
      "context_hash": 15549971102919574602,
      "translation": "동일한 이름 변경에 대한 `IN_MOVED_FROM` 이벤트와 `IN_MOVED_TO` 이벤트는 같은 `cookie` 값을 공유합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "If only one side is watched, you get an `IN_MOVED_FROM` or `IN_MOVED_TO` without the matching pair — detect cross-directory renames that way.",
      "source_hash": 15172526969846828046,
      "context_hash": 15520971158612523172,
      "translation": "한쪽만 감시하고 있다면 짝이 맞는 이벤트 없이 `IN_MOVED_FROM` 또는 `IN_MOVED_TO`만 받게 되므로, 이를 통해 디렉터리 간 이름 변경을 감지하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "inotify limits",
      "source_hash": 10984830757863453463,
      "context_hash": 6169846035554446524,
      "translation": "inotify 한도",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "inotify limitations",
      "source_hash": 1764585091200261846,
      "context_hash": 2934979463786619532,
      "translation": "inotify의 제약 사항",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "**Recursive watching**: inotify does not watch subdirectories automatically — you must add a watch for each directory",
      "source_hash": 9216967362277465609,
      "context_hash": 17250428288986266035,
      "translation": "**재귀적 감시**: inotify는 하위 디렉터리를 자동으로 감시하지 않으므로, 각 디렉터리마다 감시를 추가해야 합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "**No event for the watcher itself**: if the watched directory is deleted, you get `IN_DELETE_SELF` but cannot watch the replacement",
      "source_hash": 716245037825286058,
      "context_hash": 7376521785183016916,
      "translation": "**감시 대상 자체에 대한 이벤트 없음**: 감시 중인 디렉터리가 삭제되면 `IN_DELETE_SELF`를 받지만, 이를 대체하는 디렉터리는 감시할 수 없습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "**Network filesystems**: inotify may not work on NFS, CIFS (depends on server support)",
      "source_hash": 11419857426884965526,
      "context_hash": 322326430906327058,
      "translation": "**네트워크 파일시스템**: inotify는 NFS, CIFS에서 동작하지 않을 수 있습니다(서버 지원 여부에 따라 다름)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "**Overflow loses events**: `IN_Q_OVERFLOW` tells you events were dropped but not which ones",
      "source_hash": 16452247992026606598,
      "context_hash": 13478679785288139311,
      "translation": "**오버플로 시 이벤트 손실**: `IN_Q_OVERFLOW`는 이벤트가 누락되었다는 사실은 알려 주지만 어떤 이벤트가 누락되었는지는 알려 주지 않습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "fanotify: filesystem-wide event notification",
      "source_hash": 13060093037269872935,
      "context_hash": 14138332153992993655,
      "translation": "fanotify: 파일시스템 전역 이벤트 알림",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`fanotify` was introduced in Linux 2.6.36 by Eric Paris at Red Hat [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/ff0b16a9850e8a240ad59e10b0a1291a8fcf7cbc) and fully enabled in Linux 2.6.37.",
      "source_hash": 12379551843097929027,
      "context_hash": 598280486016108249,
      "translation": "`fanotify`는 Red Hat의 Eric Paris가 Linux 2.6.36에서 도입했으며 [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/ff0b16a9850e8a240ad59e10b0a1291a8fcf7cbc), Linux 2.6.37에서 완전히 활성화되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "Red Hat": "Red Hat"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It is a superset of inotify with additional capabilities:",
      "source_hash": 16537046290779565562,
      "context_hash": 15887313291869019287,
      "translation": "fanotify는 inotify의 상위 집합으로, 다음과 같은 추가 기능을 제공합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Watch entire mount points, not just individual files/dirs",
      "source_hash": 8745029890594723733,
      "context_hash": 9497734450854395063,
      "translation": "개별 파일/디렉터리뿐 아니라 마운트 지점 전체 감시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Receive the file descriptor of the changed file (open for reading)",
      "source_hash": 6491957997329813756,
      "context_hash": 2242751538498232699,
      "translation": "변경된 파일의 파일 디스크립터 수신(읽기용으로 열린 상태)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "file descriptor": "파일 디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Permission events**: intercept access and deny it (used by AV scanners)",
      "source_hash": 17443228733421755573,
      "context_hash": 17665756153269847831,
      "translation": "**권한 이벤트**: 접근을 가로채 거부(AV 스캐너에서 사용)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Watch for filesystem-wide changes (all files on a mount)",
      "source_hash": 18091423792633496815,
      "context_hash": 3938288663355371707,
      "translation": "파일시스템 전역 변경 감시(마운트 내 모든 파일)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "fanotify permission events",
      "source_hash": 8935471807333875354,
      "context_hash": 15806491840030014312,
      "translation": "fanotify 권한 이벤트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`FAN_CLASS_CONTENT` (for `FAN_OPEN_PERM` etc.) requires `CAP_SYS_ADMIN`.",
      "source_hash": 13267777455895361610,
      "context_hash": 5530642778024524936,
      "translation": "`FAN_CLASS_CONTENT`(`FAN_OPEN_PERM` 등에 사용)에는 `CAP_SYS_ADMIN`이 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "This is how antivirus software (like ClamAV's `clamonacc`) implements on-access scanning on Linux.",
      "source_hash": 17481192344261465684,
      "context_hash": 339569977040321071,
      "translation": "안티바이러스 소프트웨어(ClamAV의 `clamonacc` 등)는 이 방식으로 Linux에서 접근 시 검사(on-access scanning)를 구현합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "fanotify mark types (5.1+)",
      "source_hash": 15523044251610885425,
      "context_hash": 12286194322172832005,
      "translation": "fanotify 마크 유형(5.1+)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel implementation: fsnotify",
      "source_hash": 5578007419009264023,
      "context_hash": 10818458360447437291,
      "translation": "커널 구현: fsnotify",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Both `inotify` and `fanotify` are built on top of `fsnotify`, a generic filesystem notification framework:",
      "source_hash": 4408443551357521198,
      "context_hash": 10994062419547946518,
      "translation": "`inotify`와 `fanotify`는 모두 범용 파일시스템 알림 프레임워크인 `fsnotify` 위에 구축되어 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "When a VFS operation occurs (e.g., `vfs_write`):",
      "source_hash": 5353001492199637154,
      "context_hash": 9982633631575611545,
      "translation": "VFS 연산(예: `vfs_write`)이 발생하면:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "VFS": "VFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "VFS hook points",
      "source_hash": 5433327649955726635,
      "context_hash": 4455779956019455573,
      "translation": "VFS 훅 지점",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "VFS": "VFS",
        "hook": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:11.997147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
